WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:07.560
Every year, Iceland gets wider by two centimetres.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:18.160
A cow with a name will produce 450 more pints
of milk a year than one without a name.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:25.020
In 2011, scientists re-measured Norway's beaches,
islands and fjords, adding 11,000 miles to

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.650
its coastline.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:32.080
The labourers who built the Great Wall of
China were were fed on sauerkraut.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:38.770
People who pirate music also buy more music
legally than people who don't pirate.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:42.210
The human brain cannot feel pain.

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:46.430
Guinness isn't black; it's very dark red.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:52.230
The closer a woman is to the equator, the
more likely she is to give birth to a girl.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:57.430
Nicotine increases the body's metabolism of
caffeine, and therefore can reduce the impact

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:59.469
of caffeine's effects.

00:00:59.469 --> 00:01:03.539
The average London pigeon has 1.6 feet.

00:01:03.539 --> 00:01:08.830
If you stood on the Martian equator at noon,
it would feel like summer at your feet and

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:10.660
winter at your head.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:14.860
You can tell if someone is yawning from their
eyes alone.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:22.090
The 25th November 2012 was the first day since
1960 that there was no murder or manslaughter

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:24.250
in New York City.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:28.920
In ancient Rome, fathers had the legal right
to kill their children.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:35.780
German mothers-to-be are said to have 'roast
dinners' not 'buns' in their 'ovens'.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:41.310
According to the Mayan calendar, the next
time the 'world is going to end' is 3rd May

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:56.400
7138.

